  "comment": "Kosha SMS pattern library (spec Phase 2). Patterns are data, not code: new bank formats are data PRs. Regexes use named groups: amount, last4, merchant, ref. Sender codes are DLT header cores (VM-HDFCBK-S normalizes to HDFCBK).",
